data: {"id": "897af6293e8c4228-thinking-layer-379", "run_id": "897af6293e8c4228", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload-68c557d875-bsq52` 当前状态为 `Pending`，且未绑定到任何节点 (`NODE: <none>`, `IP: <none>`)。这表明调度器无法将该 Pod 调度到集群中的任何节点上。\n\n根据异常类型定义，这属于 **PendingUnschedulable** 类型。\n\n**异常组分析：**\n*   **Abnormal Group 1**: `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52`\n    *   **状态关键字 (pod_status_keyword)**: `Pending`\n    *   **异常类型 (pod_abnormal_type)**: `PodPendingUnschedulable`\n    *   **状态分类 (status_category)**: `UNHEALTHY`\n\n针对 `PodPendingUnschedulable` 类型，我将获取对应的 Runbook 以辅助后续的证据收集（虽然当前步骤仅要求定位，但根据指令需获取相关 Runbook）。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788760324109}

