data: {"id": "897af6293e8c4228-thinking-parallel_evidence-1764", "run_id": "897af6293e8c4228", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实总结\n\n### 1. 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52`\n- **UID**: `78de30b1-06ec-4314-9120-26d93c29a48a`\n- **Phase**: **Pending**（持续未变）\n- **NodeName**: `<none>` — 未被调度到任何节点\n- **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-68c557d875` → Deployment `workload`\n\n### 2. Pending 的直接原因：调度失败\n- **事件（61s 前）**：`Warning FailedScheduling`\n- **原文**：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n- **PodScheduled condition**: `status=False, reason=Unschedulable`\n\n### 3. 根", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788760367991, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

